{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:PredictedSpectra.OptimalNormalFormValley","@type":"LeanModule","name":"PredictedSpectra.OptimalNormalFormValley","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic"],"declarations":4,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OptimalNF.optimal_nf_is_standard_basis","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OptimalNF.optimal_nf_is_standard_basis","kind":"theorem","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/optimal-normal-form-valley.lean#L38-L56","doc":"**Optimal Normal Form theorem.**  In the valley of stability, the\n`I₈ + I₉`-reduced Gröbner–Shirshov normal form of `N(Z, N)` is the\nstandard basis with exactly `A = Z + N` terms, whose `i`-th coefficient\nis the Markov-traced volume `V̂ᵢ(q) = markovVolume i q`.\n\nEncoded as: there is a length-`A` coefficient sequence whose every\nentry equals the corresponding per-generator Markov volume. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:thm:optimal-normal-form-valley","label":"thm:optimal-normal-form-valley","md":"quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/optimal-normal-form-valley.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OptimalNF.markovVolume","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OptimalNF.markovVolume","kind":"opaque","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/optimal-normal-form-valley.lean#L32-L36","doc":"The per-generator Markov-traced transfer-matrix volume `V̂ᵢ(q)` at\ngenerator slot `i`.  (Externally supplied by the transfer-matrix chain;\nhere abstracted as a real-valued function of the slot and `q`.) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OptimalNF.inValley","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OptimalNF.inValley","kind":"def","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/optimal-normal-form-valley.lean#L29-L30","doc":"The valley-of-stability condition `N ≥ Z - 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OptimalNF.massNumber","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OptimalNF.massNumber","kind":"def","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/optimal-normal-form-valley.lean#L26-L27","doc":"Mass number `A = Z + N`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}